  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2308.14 Office Hours",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2308.14 Office Hours.\n\n(a) For the purposes of this section, “regular office hours” means consistently scheduled periods of time during which the public may register vessels at the vessel agent’s office.\n\n(b) Each vessel agent shall maintain regular office hours.\n\n(c) Upon being appointed as a vessel agent, each agent shall file a statement setting forth the vessel agent’s regular office hours. The vessel agent shall promptly inform the department in writing of any change in the regular office hours.\n\n(d) Each vessel agent shall display a sign which provides public notice of the vessel agent's duties, posted at or near the place where the vessel agent conducts their duties.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss and moved by #8617, eff 4-28-06, (from Saf-C 2308.12) EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
